{"id":"f6ca44d32813c27a","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-minfamilies.md","title":"Relations among optimal and irredundant DNFs","display":"thm-minfamilies — Relations among optimal and irredundant DNFs","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-minfamilies","aliases":["27-thm-minfamilies"],"display":"thm-minfamilies — Relations among optimal and irredundant DNFs","depends_on":["[[27-df-irredundant]]","[[27-df-mindnf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.3, optimality vs. prime/irredundant","source_printed_pages":"142","source_pdf_pages":"166","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-minfamilies"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-minfamilies</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-minfamilies — Relations among optimal and irredundant DNFs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d7f782c53fc50060\" href=\"?note=d7f782c53fc50060\" title=\"27-df-irredundant\">27-df-irredundant</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"25e15a85dc4e265d\" href=\"?note=25e15a85dc4e265d\" title=\"27-df-mindnf\">27-df-mindnf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.3, optimality vs. prime/irredundant"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"142"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"166"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；各表示族见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d7f782c53fc50060\" href=\"?note=d7f782c53fc50060\" title=\"27-df-irredundant\">27-df-irredundant</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"25e15a85dc4e265d\" href=\"?note=25e15a85dc4e265d\" title=\"27-df-mindnf\">27-df-mindnf</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF},\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{MinDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF},\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"25e15a85dc4e265d\" href=\"?note=25e15a85dc4e265d\" title=\"27-df-mindnf\">27-df-mindnf</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IrredDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{IrredDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d7f782c53fc50060\" href=\"?note=d7f782c53fc50060\" title=\"27-df-irredundant\">27-df-irredundant</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\ne\\emptyset,\\qquad\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\ne\\emptyset,\\qquad\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>项数最优表示若可删项即矛盾；把其各项扩成 prime 不增加项数，所以 prime 最优表示存在。文字最优表示若有非 prime 项，可删文字严格降低 lc；若有可删的非空项，也严格降低 lc。空项情形：含空项表示恒 1，文字最优时其余项不能存在（若仍有非空项会增加 lc），仅 {空项} 是最优。常 0 的空表示另直接检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-irredundant","status":"resolved","id":"d7f782c53fc50060","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-irredundant]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mindnf","status":"resolved","id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-mindnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-irredundant","status":"resolved","id":"d7f782c53fc50060","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；各表示族见 [[27-df-irredundant]]、[[27-df-mindnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mindnf","status":"resolved","id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；各表示族见 [[27-df-irredundant]]、[[27-df-mindnf]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-mindnf","status":"resolved","id":"25e15a85dc4e265d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MinDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF},\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]，$\\mathrm{IrredDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-irredundant","status":"resolved","id":"d7f782c53fc50060","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MinDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF},\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-mindnf]]，$\\mathrm{IrredDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}$ 见 [[27-df-irredundant]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF},\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IrredDNF},\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimeMinDNF}(f)\\ne\\emptyset,\\qquad\\mathrm{MinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{IrredDNF}(f),\\qquad\\mathrm{LitMinDNF}(f)\\subseteq\\mathrm{PrimeIrredDNF}(f).","display":true}],"bytes":1629,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-464","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-minfamilies|thm-minfamilies — Relations among optimal and irredundant DNFs]]"}],"outgoing":["d7f782c53fc50060","25e15a85dc4e265d"]}